                                                                                        "What requires attention now?",
                                                                                        "What does not need to be maximized?"
                                                                                    ],
                                                              "downstreamUse":  [
                                                                                    "Exercise 6 distinguishes genuine responsibilities inside these domains.",
                                                                                    "Exercise 7 tests whether allocation matches the domains declared important.",
                                                                                    "Exercise 12 uses present-condition findings when selecting priorities."
                                                                                ]
                                                          }
                                           },
                                           {
