                                               "id":  "what-has-actually-been-entrusted-to-me",
                                               "title":  "What Has Actually Been Entrusted to Me?",
                                               "purpose":  "Distinguish genuine responsibility from control, availability, guilt, expectation, or the attempt to carry everything.",
                                               "mechanics":  [
                                                                 "List major responsibilities and burdens currently carried.",
                                                                 "Test each against commitment, role, genuine dependence, and reasonable transferability.",
                                                                 "Identify responsibilities that belong, responsibilities that should be shared or delegated, and burdens that should be released.",
