                                                                                        "Change",
                                                                                        "Begin",
                                                                                        "Stop"
                                                                                    ],
                                                              "downstreamUse":  [
                                                                                    "Exercise 10 designs protection against destructive repetitions and support for constructive ones.",
                                                                                    "Exercise 11 tests the costs of changing direction.",
                                                                                    "Exercise 12 selects a small number of repeated practices for the operating plan."
                                                                                ]
                                                          }
                                           },
                                           {
                                               "order":  10,
                                               "id":  "the-gates",
                                               "title":  "The Gates",
                                               "purpose":  "Convert intention into structural protection through boundaries, refusals, removals, limits, and environmental changes.",
                                               "mechanics":  [
                                                                 "Identify what deserves protection.",
                                                                 "Identify what repeatedly defeats stated intentions.",
                                                                 "Determine where access, availability, consumption, commitments, or environment require limits.",
